{"seq":1,"slug":"renaissance","title":"文艺复兴的化身","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-renaissance-man","title":"文艺复兴人","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance/the-renaissance-man","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-art","title":"对艺术的影响","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/renaissance/influence-on-art","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 文艺复兴的化身\n\n达·芬奇是文艺复兴精神的完美化身，对艺术影响深远。本章考察这一影响。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"文艺复兴人\"——他如何成为全面发展这一崇高理想的永恒象征。第二篇文档讲述\"对艺术的影响\",呈现他如何深刻塑造了西方艺术数百年的发展。\n"}